# Search-tool exclusion (ripgrep respects this; .gitignore already keeps the
# same dirs out of git). Only generated/vendored content lives here — never
# tracked source, docs, or reports. Code_search + grep should be about the
# product, not the vendor tree.
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.prestruct/
docs/_site/
*.tgz
*.lock
package-lock.json
